opo\" in VR! This app allows you to work on an imaginary (and nonsense) easy job of placing a flower on sashimis. You can play one-minute \"Sashimi Tanpopo\" mode and eternal \"Infinite Tanpopo\" mode.\n\nBoth touch controllers and hand-tracking are supported. Refresh rate 90Hz is also supported on Oculus Quest 2.", "short_description": "You can experience the Japanese internet meme \"Sashimi Tanpopo\" in VR!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "HeroCover.png", "id": "2867269120154805", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031450_2867269123488138_3321077611508274240_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=uj4suXM6H3kQ7kNvwEZtwHo&_nc_oc=AdlDNf23Zucm6KfygynwBGNZEL_ID9lWY4lvmmEgX9IVPo94HdE3AmQ6dz5Smwz5vqw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuVaWPDCsrnx5ydgdFxH9uCA5g3WZeU_1RYetx7LV1BfQ&oe=699B109A"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtMiniLandscape.png", "id": "1673107229564288", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974703_1673107236230954_2300899480350089191_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N7y2qbau9oIQ7kNvwGBkgOw&_nc_oc=Adn7FVn1MJE91PIXoWgm2YfX915JgYMG-uNbs8Fen5Kl-PYIn2pqym-cG-wb_UDbRjk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs5ylTyPbwvmMbc8dCLa4_EsaLiOL85XtyQF3DeWfPYQA&oe=699B06C7"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtPortrait.png", "id": "799405117646180", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974454_799405120979513_1375710005646570479_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yCArss-3EKgQ7kNvwELJOk2&_nc_oc=AdnngDrUzVlmik00UFTDY7H6RSXBT5o1csaYny0oFOgMi8X2_kI5W_DR5oUNGFovLGY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftVbk2Hk6PQ612iHT8K8FLpyFjvoOeu4agTd79gVgBUsQ&oe=699AE97C"}, {"file_name": "CoverArtSquare.png", "id": "462919248108982", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/